# 🍽️ Restaurant Reservation System

## 📌 Project Overview

The **Restaurant Reservation System** is a web-based application designed to simplify the process of booking tables at a restaurant.

It allows customers to explore restaurant services, check available tables, and make reservations online. The system helps reduce manual booking work and makes restaurant management more organized and efficient.

## 🎯 Objectives

- Make restaurant table booking easier.
- Reduce manual reservation processes.
- Improve customer convenience.
- Manage restaurant reservations efficiently.
- Provide a simple and user-friendly interface.

## ✨ Features

- **Online Table Reservation:** Customers can book tables online.
- **User-Friendly Interface:** Simple and easy-to-use design.
- **Reservation Management:** Organize customer booking details.
- **Responsive Design:** Access the application on different screen sizes.
- **Booking Information:** Maintain reservation-related information.

*Note: Keep only the features that are actually implemented in your project.*

